{"seq":2,"slug":"speech-recognition","title":"语音识别","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/linguistics/computational-linguistics/speech-recognition","wordCount":2193,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"语音识别\">语音识别</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>语音识别（Speech Recognition / Automatic Speech Recognition, ASR）是将人类语音信号自动转换为文本的技术。从智能手机的语音助手到会议实时字幕，从车载语音控制到医疗记录的自动转写，语音识别已经成为人机交互的关键接口。语音识别的困难在于语音信号的高度变异性——同一个词被不同人说出来、在不同环境中说出来，其声学特征可以有巨大差异。让机器在这种变异中稳定地识别出正确的词序列，是一个融合了信号处理、统计建模和语言学知识的复杂工程问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"语音识别的基本流程\">语音识别的基本流程</h3><p>传统的语音识别系统由三个核心模块组成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"语音信号 → 特征提取 → 声学模型 → 语言模型 → 文本输出&#10;                                      ↑&#10;                              发音词典（词到音素映射）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>语音信号 → 特征提取 → 声学模型 → 语言模型 → 文本输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                      ↑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                              发音词典（词到音素映射）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>特征提取</strong>：将原始声波转换为紧凑的数学表示。最常用的特征是梅尔频率倒谱系数（MFCC），它模拟了人耳对不同频率的非线性感知特性。具体步骤是：对信号加窗分帧（每帧约25毫秒）→ 做快速傅里叶变换 → 通过梅尔滤波器组 → 取对数 → 做离散余弦变换。最终每帧语音被表示为一个约13维的向量（加上一阶和二阶差分共39维）。</p>\n<p><strong>声学模型</strong>：计算给定特征序列条件下各音素序列的概率。传统系统使用高斯混合模型-隐马尔可夫模型（GMM-HMM），每个音素用一个HMM建模，HMM的每个状态的发射概率用GMM建模。</p>\n<p><strong>语言模型</strong>：计算词序列的先验概率——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>我想吃饭</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{我想吃饭})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">我想吃饭</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>我想吃翻</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{我想吃翻})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">我想吃翻</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。N-gram语言模型（基于前N-1个词预测下一个词的概率）长期是标准选择。</p>\n<p><strong>解码</strong>：综合声学模型和语言模型找到最可能的文本输出。使用贝叶斯框架：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>W</mi></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>W</mi></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{W} = \\arg\\max_{W} P(W|X) = \\arg\\max_{W} P(X|W) \\cdot P(W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4943em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4943em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>是特征序列，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>是候选文本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(X|W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>来自声学模型，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>来自语言模型。Viterbi算法和Beam Search是常用的解码算法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从传统方法到端到端模型\">从传统方法到端到端模型</h3><p>深度学习从根本上改变了语音识别的技术路线。</p>\n<p><strong>DNN-HMM混合系统（2012年起）</strong>：用深度神经网络替代GMM来计算HMM的发射概率。这一简单替换就将错误率降低了约30%——Hinton等人在2012年发表的论文标志着深度学习在语音识别中的正式突破。</p>\n<p><strong>端到端模型</strong>：取消了传统系统中声学模型、发音词典和语言模型的分离，直接从声学特征到文本的一步建模。</p>\n<p>三种主流的端到端架构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>核心思路</th>\n<th>代表工作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CTC（Connectionist Temporal Classification）</td>\n<td>引入blank标签解决输入输出长度不对齐问题</td>\n<td>Baidu DeepSpeech</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attention-based Encoder-Decoder</td>\n<td>编码器压缩语音信息，注意力机制对齐输入输出，解码器生成文本</td>\n<td>Listen, Attend and Spell (LAS)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transducer（RNN-T）</td>\n<td>结合CTC和Attention的优点，支持流式识别</td>\n<td>Google Streaming ASR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Whisper</strong>（OpenAI, 2022）是近年最具影响力的端到端语音识别系统。它在68万小时的多语言监督数据上训练，支持99种语言的识别，并且具备语言检测、语音翻译和时间戳标注等多种能力。Whisper展示了&quot;足够大的数据+足够大的模型&quot;策略在语音识别中的威力——在无需领域适配的情况下达到了接近商业系统的性能。</p>\n<h3 id=\"语音识别面临的挑战\">语音识别面临的挑战</h3><p><strong>口音和方言变异</strong>：不同说话者的发音差异极大——方言口音、个人语音特征、年龄和性别差异。识别非标准口音仍然是当前系统的弱点。中文语音识别额外面临方言影响（带方言口音的普通话）和多音字歧义的挑战。</p>\n<p><strong>噪声环境</strong>：背景噪音（交通、音乐、人群）严重影响识别准确率。远场语音识别（如智能音箱场景，麦克风距说话者数米）比近场（如手机）困难得多。多通道麦克风阵列和波束成形（beamforming）技术用于增强目标语音。</p>\n<p><strong>连续语音与协同发音</strong>：人在自然说话时，词与词之间没有明显的停顿，相邻音素之间存在协同发音效应（前一个音影响后一个音的发音）。这与孤立词识别形成了巨大的难度落差。</p>\n<p><strong>同音词歧义</strong>：中文中大量的同音词（如&quot;制造&quot;和&quot;知道&quot;在某些方言中发音接近）需要依赖语言模型和上下文来消歧。</p>\n<h3 id=\"语音识别的评价指标\">语音识别的评价指标</h3><p>**词错误率（Word Error Rate, WER）**是最标准的评估指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WER = \\frac{S + D + I}{N} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>是替换错误数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>是删除错误数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>是插入错误数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>是参考文本的总词数。</p>\n<p>中文语音识别通常使用字错误率（Character Error Rate, CER），因为中文没有明确的词边界。</p>\n<p>当前主流商业系统在标准测试集上的WER已经低于5%（英语），某些场景下甚至低于人类转录员的错误率。但在高噪声、强口音、专业领域术语等挑战条件下，错误率仍然显著上升。</p>\n<h3 id=\"语音识别的应用场景\">语音识别的应用场景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>技术要求</th>\n<th>挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语音助手（Siri, 小爱）</td>\n<td>低延迟、流式识别</td>\n<td>远场噪声、唤醒词检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会议/课堂转写</td>\n<td>多说话人分离、长时间</td>\n<td>说话人重叠、专业术语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>医疗语音记录</td>\n<td>高准确率、专业词汇</td>\n<td>医学术语、口语化表达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字幕生成</td>\n<td>实时性、时间对齐</td>\n<td>背景音乐、情感语气</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语音搜索</td>\n<td>短语音、意图理解</td>\n<td>多义查询、口语化查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"语音识别与语言学\">语音识别与语言学</h3><p>语音识别技术的发展也为语言学研究提供了工具。大规模自动语音转写使得口语语料库的建设成为可能——手动转写耗时耗力（1小时录音需要4-8小时手动转写），自动系统可以将这一时间缩短到接近实时。但自动转写的错误需要后续人工校正，特别是涉及方言、非标准发音和专有名词的场景。</p>\n<p>语音识别的错误模式本身也有语言学价值——系统倾向于犯什么错误（如容易混淆的音素对、容易出错的语法结构）可以揭示语音信号中不同语言层级信息的编码密度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>为什么传统语音识别系统需要分离声学模型和语言模型？端到端系统将它们合并后有什么优势和可能的问题？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>中文语音识别中的同音词问题（如&quot;期中/其中&quot;、&quot;制造/知道&quot;）如何通过语言模型来解决？语言模型在这里承担什么角色？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>你使用的语音助手（如Siri、小爱同学）在什么情况下容易出错？尝试从噪声、口音、词汇覆盖的角度分析原因。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>语音识别的WER已经在某些条件下低于人类，这是否意味着机器&quot;听懂&quot;了语言？&quot;听懂&quot;和&quot;转写正确&quot;有什么区别？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>俞栋、邓力：《语音识别：从传统方法到深度学习》——涵盖传统和深度学习方法的全面教材</li>\n<li>Jurafsky &amp; Martin：《Speech and Language Processing》Ch.16——语音识别章节</li>\n<li>Radford et al.（2022）：Whisper论文——大规模弱监督语音识别</li>\n<li>Graves et al.（2006）：CTC原论文——端到端语音识别的奠基工作</li>\n<li>Hinton et al.（2012）：深度神经网络在语音识别中应用的里程碑论文</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>语音识别将人类语音转换为机器可处理的文本，是人机交互的关键技术。传统系统由特征提取、声学模型、语言模型和解码器组成，深度学习将这些模块统一为端到端模型。CTC、Attention和Transducer是三种主流的端到端架构。Whisper等大规模预训练模型展示了数据驱动方法在多语言识别中的巨大潜力。口音变异、噪声环境和同音词歧义仍然是技术挑战。词错误率已经在标准条件下接近或低于人类水平，但&quot;稳健的&quot;语音识别——在任何条件下都可靠地工作——仍然是一个活跃的研究方向。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语音识别","id":"语音识别"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"语音识别的基本流程","id":"语音识别的基本流程"},{"level":3,"text":"从传统方法到端到端模型","id":"从传统方法到端到端模型"},{"level":3,"text":"语音识别面临的挑战","id":"语音识别面临的挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"语音识别的评价指标","id":"语音识别的评价指标"},{"level":3,"text":"语音识别的应用场景","id":"语音识别的应用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"语音识别与语言学","id":"语音识别与语言学"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自然语言处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/linguistics/computational-linguistics/natural-language-processing"},"next":{"title":"机器翻译","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/linguistics/computational-linguistics/machine-translation"}}